    "title": "Community invited to annual recovery walk in Kingwood | Preston County News | wvnews.com",
    "text": "KINGWOOD, W.Va. (WV News) — In observance of National Recovery Month, community members are invited to participate in the first Preston County Recovery Walk, organized by local peer recovery coaches.\nAccording to the CDC, since 1989 Recovery Month has been observed every September to celebrate the gains made by those in recovery from substance use disorder. The month also promotes and supports new treatment and recovery practices, the nation’s strong and proud recovery community, and the dedication of service providers and communities who make recovery in all its forms possible.",
